---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="mt-16 border-t border-border-subtle bg-bg-surface">
  <div
    class="mx-auto flex max-w-[88rem] flex-col gap-4 px-4 py-8 text-sm text-text-muted sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between sm:px-6"
  >
    <div class="max-w-md space-y-2">
      <p class="font-display text-md font-bold text-text-primary">
        lol<span class="text-accent">perform</span>
      </p>
      <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed">
        Bot-lane-first League of Legends tier list and matchup data, refreshed every patch.
        Every statistic carries its sample size — see the
        <a href="/methodology" class="text-accent">methodology</a>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <nav aria-label="Footer" class="flex flex-col gap-1.5 text-xs">
      <a href="/tier-list" class="hover:text-text-primary">Tier List</a>
      <a href="/bot-lane" class="hover:text-text-primary">Bot Lane</a>
      <a href="/champions" class="hover:text-text-primary">Champions</a>
      <a href="/methodology" class="hover:text-text-primary">Methodology</a>
    </nav>
  </div>

  <div class="border-t border-border-subtle px-4 py-4 sm:px-6">
    <p class="mx-auto max-w-[88rem] text-2xs leading-relaxed text-text-disabled">
      lolperform.com isn't endorsed by Riot Games and doesn't reflect the views or opinions of Riot
      Games or anyone officially involved in producing or managing Riot Games properties. Riot Games
      and all associated properties are trademarks or registered trademarks of Riot Games, Inc.
      &copy; {year} lolperform.com
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
